# Artifact Recovery

## Overview

The goal of this research is to reconstruct the original file set used by Roblox WindowsPlayer `0.472.0.419960`.

The Roblox bootstrapper downloaded a package manifest and then fetched individual ZIP packages used to build the installed client directory.

Historical ANY.RUN and Hybrid Analysis reports preserved several of those downloaded files and their hashes.

## Exact Package Manifest

The recovered package manifest for `version-0137f7d4848f436a` identifies the package set required by the client.

Important packages include:

- `RobloxApp.zip`
- `content-avatar.zip`
- `content-configs.zip`
- `content-fonts.zip`
- `content-models.zip`
