## LuaPackages

The most important package for the Desktop Beta interface research is:

`extracontent-luapackages.zip`

Exact MD5:

`67ee59d37a7aeda3d73a7ee4b0de648e`

Expected compressed size:

`3036167` bytes

Hybrid Analysis recorded a file named:

`67ee59d37a7aeda3d73a7ee4b0de648e.part`

Its recorded size is exactly `3036167` bytes and its MD5 is exactly `67ee59d37a7aeda3d73a7ee4b0de648e`, showing that the full package was present in the sandbox artifact set even though the filename retained the `.part` suffix.

Recorded SHA-256:

`9de1405e9141a75b5d3d4a104d0a4c3e4dd63d173b6b40fe10a2715be9b273db`

